ient.eu/Medieval_Hygiene/ (accessed on 12 February 2020). 62. Daungthima, W.; Kazunori, H. Assessing the Flood Impacts and the Cultural Properties Vulnerabilities in Ayutthaya, Thailand. Procedia Environ. Sci. 2013, 17, 739–748. [CrossRef]",4148
