unidoc_crm_0193,10,page-9-chunk-1,9,0.3671572804450989,5.1442217227304354e-05,"9 | Page TUESDAY TRAVEL SERIES with Kemp Travel Given that travel is limited during these times, we invite you to join us as Erin Kemp highlights everything to keep your travel dreams alive. Please contact events@bowmanvilleolderadults.com for additional details and updates. Bring your questions and inquiries as there will be time for discussion after each presentation. Tuesday August 24th 1:30 pm to 2:30 pm – Vancouver Island Adventure *Erin will be travelling to the island at the end of July and will share a recap, showing pictures and videos Click to Join: https://bowmanvilleolderadults.zoom.us/j/99653791261?pwd=Y0V3SUR4QTJweG1hcy9t VDRYdE54QT09 Meeting ID: 996 5379 1261 Passcode: 108466 SMILE TIME with The Smile Theatre Serenaders The Smile Theatre Serenaders are throwing a party online, and you're invited! There will be singing, chatting, and dancing - sure to put a bounce in your step and a smile on your face. Every Tuesday, spend a fun and relaxed time sharing music and stories together, always with lots of fun, energy and special guests, too! Tuesday at 3 pm to 3:30 pm August 17th, August 24th & August 31st No event August 3rd and 10th Click to join: https://bowmanvilleolderadults.zoom.us/j/99331760557?pwd=QXVaYTB4WGJHODNwW FRVNVR4ZkxuQT09 Meeting ID: 993 3176 0557 Passcode: 287625",1310
