unidoc_crm_0193,12,page-11-chunk-1,11,0.3252865672111511,2.586742994026281e-05,"11 | Page VIRTUAL ART PROGRAMS ON ZOOM: PEN AND INK: ADDING WATERCOLOUR with Dianne Darch This class is for participants who would like to learn how to add watercolour to a project(s) from this session. Please contact programs@bowmanvilleolderadults.com for the supply list for this project. Wednesday 1 pm to 2:30 pm August 18th & August 25th NEW LINK Click to join: https://bowmanvilleolderadults.zoom.us/j/99939560261?pwd=OTRmOG1QVjVHdjNnVGJ 3aHFwZEFBQT09 Meeting ID: 999 3956 0261 Passcode: 549281 BEGINNERS WATERCOLOUR with Julieta Cortes Learn basic watercolour techniques and colour mixing, while painting a step-by-step project each week. No drawing skills required. Please contact admin@bowmanvilleolderadults.com for a supply list and weekly template. Thursday 1 pm to 3 pm Running Weekly Until August 26th Click to join: https://bowmanvilleolderadults.zoom.us/j/96326986539?pwd=L0xXc3dpbDJEcnBHd0xq RVFZWEtTdz09 Meeting ID: 963 2698 6539 Passcode: 759464 INTERMEDIATE WATERCOLOUR with Julieta Cortes Challenge yourself by painting your own project with this theme-based class while working at your own pace to enhance your skills. Each participant will select their own picture suitable for watercolour, as well as learn composition. Friday 1:30 pm to 3:30 pm Running Weekly Until August 27th Click to join: https://bowmanvilleolderadults.zoom.us/j/93559258791?pwd=TkpFZFhPY0hhWFZXNHl yQWE4NHJzQT09 Meeting ID: 935 5925 8791 Passcode: 097974",1452
