unidoc_crm_0193,14,page-15-chunk-1,15,0.24529674649238586,2.1444948288262822e-05,"15 | Page GENTLE YOGA with Sharon Wildeboer This is great for those looking for a more gentle approach to yoga. Emphasis is made on poses and proper breathing techniques. Transitions from standing to the mat are kept to a minimum. Monday NEW TIME 10:05 am to 11:00 am Running Weekly Until August 30th No class August 2nd Click to join: https://zoom.us/j/98061679709?pwd=T1c5MmM5TmJicEovRVZUeW1PM3V3QT09 Meeting ID: 980 6167 9709 Password: 080564 GUIDED MEDITATION with Julie Ditta Guided meditation triggers a relaxation response which has many health benefits such as increased energy, lower blood pressure, stronger immune systems and relief from aches and pains. In this session, you will learn a variety of techniques including deep breathing, muscle relaxation, massage and meditation to quiet the mind, reduce worrying, while improving sleep and memory. Feeling relaxed creates a positive perspective and enhances an overall sense of well-being and vitality. Friday NEW TIME 12:30 pm to 1:25 pm Running Weekly Until August 27th Click to join: https://zoom.us/j/95682386244?pwd=Y01mRnRYT3k2OEVoWDZJRUNsK3d4dz09 Meeting ID: 956 8238 6244 Passcode: 989164 MEDITATION with Michelle Cook Do you ever worry, feel up-tight or panicky, get confused, can’t sleep or get down in the dumps? Then meditation might be the answer for you. Simply put, meditation equals stress reduction, which equals health promotion. This program will provide different varieties of meditation focusing on deep breathing, body relaxation, letting go and guided mental imagery. Guided meditation helps to improve memory, energy, and sleep. It creates a positive perspective and enhances an overall sense of well-being and vitality. We will conclude with time to share experiences. Wednesday 11 am to 11:55 am Running Weekly Until August 25th NEW LINK Click to join: https://bowmanvilleolderadults.zoom.us/j/95455315451?pwd=dTcwRWMrZXBQRHhzZk VYVmZhRllrdz09 Meeting ID: 954 5531 5451 Passcode: 456492",1974
unidoc_crm_0193,15,page-8-chunk-1,8,0.3411042392253876,1.8925147742265835e-05,"8 | Page VIRTUAL EVENTS ON ZOOM: NEW TORONTO PEARSON COMMUNITY CONNECTS SERIES Join the team from Toronto Pearson as they provide a unique look at what it takes to keep our airport operating safely every day. Toronto Pearson is much more than simply a place where planes land and take off. They are more than just an airport. Meet with our team virtually as they share different subject matter from the experts. Learn about the history of the airport, its economic impact, its operations and how they are giving back to local communities. Tuesday August 24th at 11 am to 12 pm: Airport Collaborative Decision Making (A-CDM) Tuesday September 7th at 11 am to 12 pm: Pearson’s Healthy Airport program: Learn how they’re putting your health first Click to Join: https://bowmanvilleolderadults.zoom.us/j/83338983691?pwd=eUZPRjk0c25xS3haUFdib UgzZGFqUT09 Meeting ID: 833 3898 3691 Passcode: 016454",892
