a m derivative mark et as an example for development. After 3 years of operation, the derivative stock market had a very good growth, exceeding the expectations set. The market has increasingly shown its role as a risk prevention tool, positively contributing to stabilizing t he underlying market and attracting the attention of domestic and foreign investors.",2281
