riers for protein unfolding limit the immunogenic- ity of foreign proteins. J Immunol. 2010; 185(7):4199– 205. Epub 2010/09/08. doi: 10.4049/jimmunol. 0902249 PMID: 20817878. 22. Sokol CL, Barton GM, Farr AG, Medzhitov R. A mechanism for the initiation of allergen-induced T help- er type 2 responses. Nat Immunol. 2008; 9(3):310– 8. Epub 2008/02/27. doi: 10.1038/ni1558 PMID: 18300366; PubMed Central PMCID: PMC3888112. 23. Nicklas W, Baneux P, Boot R, Decelle T, Deeny AA, Fumanelli M, et al. Recommendations for the health monitoring of rodent and rabbit colonies in breeding and experimental units. Laboratory animals. 2002; 36(1):20– 42. Epub 2002/02/08. PMID: 11831737. 24. Brtko J, Mostbock S, Scheiblhofer S, Hartl A, Thalhamer J. DNA immunization is associated with in- creased activity of type I iodothyronine 5'-deiodinase in mouse liver. Mol Cell Endocrinol. 1999; 152(1 – 2):85– 9. PMID: 10432226. 25. Shu X, Shaner NC, Yarbrough CA, Tsien RY, Remington SJ. Novel chromophores and buried charges control color in mFruits. Biochemistry. 2006; 45(32):9639– 47. Epub 2006/08/09. doi: 10.1021/ bi060773l PMID: 16893165. 26. Byers AM, Kemball CC, Moser JM, Lukacher AE. Cutting edge: rapid in vivo CTL activity by polyoma virus-specific effector and memory CD8+ T cells. J Immunol. 2003; 171(1):17 – 21. PMID: 12816977. 27. Gratz IK, Rosenblum MD, Maurano MM, Paw JS, Truong HA, Marshak-Rothstein A, et al. Cutting edge: Self-antigen controls the balance between effector and regulatory T cells in peripheral tissues. J Immu- nol. 2014; 192(4):1351– 5. Epub 2014/01/21. doi: 10.4049/jimmunol.1301777 PMID: 24442443; PubMed Central PMCID: PMC3925257. 28. Deressa T, Stoecklinger A, Wallner M, Himly M, Kofler S, Hainz K, et al. Structural Integrity of the Anti- gen Is a Determinant for the Induction of T-Helper Type-1 Immunity in Mice by Gene Gun Vaccines against E.coli Beta-Galactosidase. PLoS One. 2014; 9(7):e102280. Epub 2014/07/16. doi: 10.1371/ journal.pone.0102280 PMID: 25025197; Pu