nt mutations in one of the four Myb-binding sites (mut1-4) were transfected with expression vector for v-Myb REV. Transfections were analyzed as in (A). ( C) Reporter gene assays were performed in QT6 cells using the full-length or a truncated /C02.7 kb enhancer construct. Cells were additionally transfected with expression vector for v-Myb REV (black bars) or empty expression vector (white bars). Transfections were analyzed as in (A). Nucleic Acids Research, 2007, Vol. 35, No. 21 7243 at Pennsylvania State University on February 18, 2016http://nar.oxfordjournals.org/Downloaded from",2508
