ity, members of the Bids and Awards Committee (BAC), the Technical Working Group, and the BAC Secretariat, the head of the Project Management Office or the end-user unit, and the project consultants by consanguinity or affinity up to the third civil degree; 7. [Name of Bidder] complies with existing labor laws and standards; and 8. [Name of Bidder] is aware of and has undertaken the responsibil ities as a Bidder in compliance with the Philippine Bidding Documents, which includes: a. Carefully examining all of the Bidding Documents;",2461
