dent variables as explained earlier. As both time series are stationary, the term 𝛿, is constrained to be between 0 and 1. The error term 𝜀"" in both time series has a lagged component(s) specified by 𝛾, and a while noise component 𝜈"". The hypothesis H4 can be restated as 𝐻:= 𝛽;< 𝛽= ∀ 𝑗,𝑘∈(1,11),𝑗>𝑘. Since independent variable 1 to 11 denote the 11 “Takeshima Day” events (the twelfth is a non-ritualized event for reference), the later an event occurred, the smaller its effect on the bilateral conflicts because it has gradually ritualized and become part of the expectation.",2481
