unidoc_legal_0200,26,page-19-chunk-1,19,0.43093642592430115,4.006369272246957e-05,Jail Wendell Anderson – Sheriff-Coroner 6 FY 2021-2022 Proposed Budget | County of Yuba Pending Issues/Policy Considerations FY 2021-2022 Recruitment for both Correctional Officers and Reserve Correctional Officers continues to be a work in progress. The Jail is in the process of building up the Reserve program and trying to hire six additional reserve officers. The Jail will soon have five vacant full time positions to fill.,429
